---
import { twoBandSpectrum } from '../../../data/part04/ch14TeachingModels.mjs';

const componentId = 'ch14-two-band';
const width = 700;
const height = 320;
const pad = { left: 52, right: 22, top: 24, bottom: 48 };
const defaults = { coupling: 0.6, mass: 0.4 };
const xs = Array.from({ length: 201 }, (_, index) => -2.5 + 5 * index / 200);
const spectra = xs.map((x) => twoBandSpectrum({
  epsilonA: x + defaults.mass,
  epsilonB: -x - defaults.mass,
  couplingReal: defaults.coupling,
}));
const yMin = -3.4;
const yMax = 3.4;
const toPolyline = (key) => spectra.map((item, index) => {
  const x = pad.left + index * (width - pad.left - pad.right) / (spectra.length - 1);
  const y = pad.top + (yMax - item[key]) * (height - pad.top - pad.bottom) / (yMax - yMin);
  return `${x.toFixed(2)},${y.toFixed(2)}`;
}).join(' ');
const centre = twoBandSpectrum({ epsilonA: defaults.mass, epsilonB: -defaults.mass, couplingReal: defaults.coupling });
---

<figure class="chapter-visual two-band" id={componentId}>
  <figcaption>
    <strong>原创交互模型：双带杂化与能隙</strong>
    <span lang="en">Original interactive model: two-band hybridization and gap opening</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="chapter-visual__controls two-band__controls">
    <label>
      <span>杂化 |V|（能量单位）</span>
      <input data-two-coupling type="range" min="0" max="1.2" step="0.05" value={defaults.coupling} />
      <output data-two-coupling-output>{defaults.coupling.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
    <label>
      <span>对角不对称 m（能量单位）</span>
      <input data-two-mass type="range" min="-1" max="1" step="0.05" value={defaults.mass} />
      <output data-two-mass-output>{defaults.mass.toFixed(2)}</output>
    </label>
  </div>

  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${width} ${height}`} role="img" aria-labelledby={`${componentId}-title ${componentId}-desc`}>
    <title id={`${componentId}-title`}>Eigenvalues of a two-band Hamiltonian versus detuning</title>
    <desc id={`${componentId}-desc`}>Two levels with opposite detuning hybridize through a real coupling. Their minimum separation is controlled by both coupling and diagonal asymmetry.</desc>
    <line class="plot-axis" x1={pad.left} y1={height - pad.bottom} x2={width - pad.right} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <line class="plot-axis" x1={pad.left} y1={pad.top} x2={pad.left} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <line class="plot-guide" x1={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y1={pad.top} x2={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y2={height - pad.bottom} />
    <polyline class="two-band__curve two-band__curve--lower" data-two-lower points={toPolyline('lower')} />
    <polyline class="two-band__curve two-band__curve--upper" data-two-upper points={toPolyline('upper')} />
    <text x={pad.left} y={height - 15} text-anchor="middle">−2.5</text>
    <text x={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y={height - 15} text-anchor="middle">0</text>
    <text x={width - pad.right} y={height - 15} text-anchor="middle">2.5</text>
    <text x={(width + pad.left - pad.right) / 2} y={height - 2} text-anchor="middle">detuning x</text>
    <text transform={`translate(17 ${(height + pad.top - pad.bottom) / 2}) rotate(-90)`} text-anchor="middle">energy</text>
  </svg>

  <div class="chapter-visual__readout" aria-live="polite">
    <span>在 x=0 的 gap | gap at x=0:</span>
    <strong data-two-gap>{centre.gap.toFixed(3)}</strong>
    <span data-two-weight>lower-state A weight={centre.lowerAWeight.toFixed(3)}</span>
  </div>

  <div class="chapter-visual__contract">
    <p><strong>模型：</strong><code>H(x)=[[x+m,V],[V,−x−m]]</code>，所有能量使用同一任意单位。eigenvalues 为 <code>±sqrt((x+m)^2+V^2)</code>。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Model:</strong> <code>H(x)=[[x+m,V],[V,−x−m]]</code>, with one arbitrary common energy unit. Its eigenvalues are <code>±sqrt((x+m)^2+V^2)</code>.</p>
    <p><strong>验收：</strong><code>V=0,m=0</code> 时在 x=0 交叉；任一非零 V 在交叉点产生 <code>2|V|</code> avoided-crossing gap；m 平移未杂化交叉位置而不单独代表拓扑质量。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Acceptance:</strong> <code>V=0,m=0</code> crosses at x=0; nonzero V opens an avoided-crossing gap <code>2|V|</code> at the crossing. m shifts the unhybridized crossing and is not by itself a topological mass.</p>
    <p><strong>边界：</strong>这是单参数路径上的 2×2 模型，不是完整 BZ。路径上有 gap 不能证明全 BZ 绝缘，也不能从该模型直接推断材料拓扑。</p>
    <p lang="en"><strong>Boundary:</strong> this is a 2×2 model along one parameter path, not a full Brillouin zone. A gap on the path does not establish a full-BZ insulator or a material topological classification.</p>
  </div>

  <noscript><p>关闭 JavaScript 后显示 V=0.60、m=0.40 的静态双带色散。</p></noscript>
</figure>

<script>
  import { twoBandSpectrum } from '../../../data/part04/ch14TeachingModels.mjs';

  const root = document.getElementById('ch14-two-band');
  if (root) {
    const coupling = root.querySelector('[data-two-coupling]');
    const mass = root.querySelector('[data-two-mass]');
    const couplingOutput = root.querySelector('[data-two-coupling-output]');
    const massOutput = root.querySelector('[data-two-mass-output]');
    const lower = root.querySelector('[data-two-lower]');
    const upper = root.querySelector('[data-two-upper]');
    const gapOutput = root.querySelector('[data-two-gap]');
    const weightOutput = root.querySelector('[data-two-weight]');
    if (
      coupling instanceof HTMLInputElement && mass instanceof HTMLInputElement
      && couplingOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement && massOutput instanceof HTMLOutputElement
      && lower instanceof SVGPolylineElement && upper instanceof SVGPolylineElement
      && gapOutput instanceof HTMLElement && weightOutput instanceof HTMLElement
    ) {
      const width = 700;
      const height = 320;
      const pad = { left: 52, right: 22, top: 24, bottom: 48 };
      const xs = Array.from({ length: 201 }, (_, index) => -2.5 + 5 * index / 200);
      const yMin = -3.4;
      const yMax = 3.4;
      const points = (values) => values.map((value, index) => {
        const x = pad.left + index * (width - pad.left - pad.right) / (values.length - 1);
        const y = pad.top + (yMax - value) * (height - pad.top - pad.bottom) / (yMax - yMin);
        return `${x.toFixed(2)},${y.toFixed(2)}`;
      }).join(' ');
      const update = () => {
        const V = Number(coupling.value);
        const m = Number(mass.value);
        const spectra = xs.map((x) => twoBandSpectrum({ epsilonA: x + m, epsilonB: -x - m, couplingReal: V }));
        lower.setAttribute('points', points(spectra.map((item) => item.lower)));
        upper.setAttribute('points', points(spectra.map((item) => item.upper)));
        couplingOutput.value = V.toFixed(2);
        massOutput.value = m.toFixed(2);
        const centre = twoBandSpectrum({ epsilonA: m, epsilonB: -m, couplingReal: V });
        gapOutput.textContent = centre.gap.toFixed(3);
        weightOutput.textContent = `lower-state A weight=${centre.lowerAWeight.toFixed(3)}`;
      };
      coupling.addEventListener('input', update);
      mass.addEventListener('input', update);
      update();
    }
  }
</script>

<style>
  .two-band__controls { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(14rem,1fr)); gap: 0.8rem; }
  .two-band__controls label { display: grid; gap: 0.35rem; }
  .two-band input, .two-band svg { width: 100%; }
  .two-band svg text { fill: currentColor; font-size: 13px; }
  .two-band__curve { fill: none; stroke-width: 2.4; }
  .two-band__curve--lower { stroke: var(--sl-color-accent-high); }
  .two-band__curve--upper { stroke: currentColor; }
  .plot-axis { stroke: currentColor; stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .plot-guide { stroke: var(--sl-color-gray-4); stroke-dasharray: 5 5; }
</style>
